# Generated screenshot fixture — rebuild with `cargo xtask screenshot-fixture`.
# Not committed: it is derived, and a committed copy would drift from the
# generator that produces it.
#
# The default location is now /tmp/claudepot-demo-home, OUTSIDE the repo,
# because the app displays the paths it reads and an in-repo fixture put
# the author's home directory on screen. This entry stays as a net for
# anyone who passes `--out fixtures/…` explicitly.
/fixtures/screenshot-profile/
